        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG245-630, Modern Interior European Mortise Lock Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Interior European Mortise Lockset has a modern look great for contemporary spaces. It is made out of solid stainless steel with a satin stainless steel finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAHI-EU1000 Mortise Lock Specifications:\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-EU1000-specifications.gif?v=1704442282\" width=\"587\" height=\"249\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI-EU1000-Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Modern European Mortise Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  50mm</li>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 9-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Length Center to Center: 8-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Hole Cut-out Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length From Top of Plate to Center of Lever Cut-Out: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with trim plates, lever, and EU1000 mortise lock body.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a door pull or to match trim. Trim is on one side of door. Comes packaged with trim plates and  levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Comes packaged with trim plates, levers, and EU1000 mortise lock body.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side.\r\nComes packaged with trim plates, levers, and EU1000 mortise lock body.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually</i>\r\n</p>",
